{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LangChain与LlamaIndex的区别和适用场景\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LangChain与LlamaIndex的区别和适用场景\" dir=\"auto\">LangChain与LlamaIndex的区别和适用场景</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangChain和LlamaIndex是LLM应用开发中最流行的两个框架，请详细对比它们的设计理念、核心能力、适用场景，以及如何在项目中配合使用。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>核心定位对比</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">LangChain和LlamaIndex是<strong>互补关系</strong>，分别解决了LLM应用开发的不同层面问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>LangChain</th>\n<th>LlamaIndex</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>核心定位</strong></td>\n<td>工作流编排引擎</td>\n<td>数据检索与知识管理引擎</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>设计重心</strong></td>\n<td>多步骤推理、工具编排、条件逻辑</td>\n<td>数据摄入、索引构建、语义检索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>主要抽象</strong></td>\n<td>Chain/Agent/Tool/Prompt</td>\n<td>Index/Retriever/QueryEngine/Node</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>架构风格</strong></td>\n<td>管道式/图式编排</td>\n<td>索引-检索-合成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>强项</strong></td>\n<td>复杂工作流设计、多工具协调</td>\n<td>数据检索效率、RAG优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最佳场景</strong></td>\n<td>复杂Agent、条件分支、工具链</td>\n<td>文档问答、知识库搜索、数据RAG</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>形象比喻：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>LangChain</strong>是\"<strong>项目经理</strong>\"——负责统筹安排各种资源，决定任务执行顺序，处理异常情况</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>LlamaIndex</strong>是\"<strong>图书管理员</strong>\"——负责整理和分类知识，在你需要时快速找到最相关的信息</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>配合使用模式：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 模式1：LlamaIndex作为LangChain的Retriever</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> llama_index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>core <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> VectorStoreIndex\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chains <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> RetrievalQA\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 用LlamaIndex构建索引</span>\nindex <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> VectorStoreIndex<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>docs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nretriever <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> index<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>as_retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 在LangChain链中使用</span>\nqa_chain <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> RetrievalQA<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_chain_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    llm<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    retriever<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>retriever<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># LlamaIndex的检索器</span>\n    chain_type<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"stuff\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 模式2：在LangGraph节点中使用LlamaIndex</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">retrieve_node</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    query <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> state<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 使用LlamaIndex进行高级检索</span>\n    response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> query_engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"context\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 模式3：LangChain Tool + LlamaIndex查询</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Tool\n\nllama_index_tool <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    name<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"knowledge_base\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    func<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> q<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query_engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>q<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    description<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"查询公司内部知识库\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>选型决策：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐框架</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>简单RAG问答</td>\n<td>LlamaIndex</td>\n<td>开箱即用，数据优化更完善</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂Agent工作流</td>\n<td>LangChain/LangGraph</td>\n<td>编排能力更强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要工具调用的RAG</td>\n<td>LangChain + LlamaIndex</td>\n<td>各取所长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>企业知识库</td>\n<td>LlamaIndex</td>\n<td>高级检索策略和索引优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多步骤审批流程</td>\n<td>LangGraph</td>\n<td>条件分支和人工干预</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：在生产环境中，LangChain和LlamaIndex结合使用的最佳实践是什么？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：用LlamaIndex处理数据侧的加载、索引、检索优化；用LangChain/LangGraph处理应用侧的工作流编排、工具调用、条件逻辑。通过<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">as_retriever()</code>或自定义Tool将LlamaIndex嵌入LangChain生态。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：必须在LangChain和LlamaIndex之间二选一。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：两个框架可以无缝集成。实际上，很多生产系统同时使用两者——LlamaIndex处理数据检索，LangChain处理工作流编排。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}